Changes:
 libzstd (1.5.5+dfsg2-2build1.1+safelibs1) unstable; urgency=medium
 .
   * Rebuild the Debian package layout around the safe Rust libzstd ABI.
   * Preserve the upstream package names, examples, docs, manpages, and
     autopkgtests.
   * Make the Phase 4 producer scripts the only canonical refresh path for the
     safe install tree, helper root, staged Debian source tree, and package
     outputs.
